(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Python Variable Naming Conventions \(PEP 8\) and NameError exceptions. Discuss common scenarios that trigger NameError and how to resolve them.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. PEP 8 Variable Naming Conventions:) Tj
T*
(   PEP 8 defines standardized guidelines for identifiers across Python codebases:) Tj
T*
(   - Variable & Function Names: snake_case \(all lowercase words joined by underscores\), e.g.,) Tj
T*
(   student_count, calculate_area.) Tj
T*
(   - Constant Identifiers: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE \(all uppercase words\), e.g., MAX_RETRIES, PI_VALUE.) Tj
T*
(   - Class Names: PascalCase \(CapWords convention\), e.g., NeuralNetwork, DatabaseConnection.) Tj
T*
(   - Private Attributes: Leading single underscore \(_internal_cache\) for non-public API; leading) Tj
T*
(   double underscore \(__mangled_attr\) for name mangling in inheritance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Identifier Rules:) Tj
T*
(   - Must start with a letter \(a-z, A-Z\) or underscore \(_\).) Tj
T*
(   - Subsequent characters can be letters, digits \(0-9\), or underscores.) Tj
T*
(   - Cannot contain whitespace or special symbols \(@, $, %, ^, &, *\).) Tj
T*
(   - Cannot match any of the 35 Python keywords \(def, class, while, etc.\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The NameError Exception and Common Causes:) Tj
T*
(   NameError occurs when the interpreter attempts to evaluate a symbolic identifier that cannot be) Tj
T*
(   found in any of the four LEGB scopes \(Local, Enclosing, Global, Built-in\).) Tj
T*
(   Common Scenarios:) Tj
T*
(   - Scenario A: Typographical error in variable name.) Tj
T*
(   - Scenario B: Accessing a variable before its declaration or initialization.) Tj
T*
(   - Scenario C: Using a local variable before assignment \(UnboundLocalError, a subclass of) Tj
T*
(   NameError\).) Tj
T*
(   - Scenario D: Calling an unimported function or module.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Python Demonstration Code:) Tj
T*
(   # Resolution Demonstration) Tj
T*
(   def safe_variable_lookup\(\):) Tj
T*
(   # Correct declaration and initialization) Tj
T*
(   total_score = 100) Tj
T*
(   bonus_multiplier = 1.15) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   try:) Tj
T*
(   # Intentional typo triggering NameError) Tj
T*
(   final_result = totl_score * bonus_multiplier) Tj
T*
(   except NameError as ex:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Handled Error: {ex}"\)) Tj
T*
(   # Remediation: Use correctly spelled variable) Tj
T*
(   final_result = total_score * bonus_multiplier) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Remediated Calculation: {final_result:.2f}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
