T*
(   3. String Operations:) Tj
T*
(   - Concatenation \(+\): Combines two strings into a new string: 'Py' + 'thon' -> 'Python'.) Tj
T*
(   - Repetition \(*\): Replicates string n times: 'abc' * 3 -> 'abcabcabc'.) Tj
T*
(   - Membership \(in, not in\): Substring search in O\(N\) worst-case time using two-way string search) Tj
T*
(   algorithm.) Tj
