(   5. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Inefficient += loop: O\(N^2\) time due to repeated reallocations and copies.) Tj
T*
(   - str.join\(list\): O\(N\) linear time with single-pass memory pre-allocation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
