/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Modern Python String Formatting Paradigms: % formatting, str.format\(\), and Formatted String Literals \(F-Strings\). Compare performance and readability.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Evolution of String Formatting in Python:) Tj
T*
(   Python has supported three distinct formatting paradigms across its evolutionary history:) Tj
T*
(   1. Old-Style printf Formatting \(% Operator\): Borrowed from ANSI C printf syntax. Uses format) Tj
T*
(   specifiers like %d, %s, %f. Prone to tuple unpacking bugs and poor readability.) Tj
T*
(   2. str.format\(\) Method \(Python 2.6+\): Uses curly braces {} with positional and keyword) Tj
T*
(   arguments. Provides cleaner syntax but can become verbose with complex nested variables.) Tj
T*
(   3. Formatted String Literals / F-Strings \(Python 3.6+, PEP 498\): Prefixed with f or F.) Tj
T*
(   Expressions inside {expr} are evaluated directly at runtime in the caller's scope. F-strings) Tj
T*
(   compile into specialized BUILD_STRING and FORMAT_VALUE bytecode, making them faster than % and) Tj
T*
(   str.format\(\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Feature Comparison Matrix:) Tj
T*
(   - Readability: F-Strings > str.format\(\) > % Formatting.) Tj
T*
(   - Speed: F-Strings \(Compiled bytecode\) > % Formatting \(C routine\) > str.format\(\) \(Method lookup) Tj
T*
(   overhead\).) Tj
T*
(   - Arbitrary Expression Evaluation: F-Strings support arbitrary Python code within braces:) Tj
T*
(   f'{math.sqrt\(x\):.2f}'.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   name = "Aarav") Tj
T*
(   score = 94.6782) Tj
T*
(   exam_id = 402) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 1. % Formatting) Tj
T*
(   old_style = "Student %s \(ID: %04d\) achieved %.2f%%" % \(name, exam_id, score\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 2. str.format\(\)) Tj
T*
(   mid_style = "Student {} \(ID: {:04d}\) achieved {:.2f}%".format\(name, exam_id, score\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 3. Modern F-String) Tj
T*
(   new_style = f"Student {name} \(ID: {exam_id:04d}\) achieved {score:.2f}%") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("Formatting Comparison Results:"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Old Style: ", old_style\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Mid Style: ", mid_style\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("F-String: ", new_style\)) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
