(   [Problem Statement]: Design an interactive Python console application that computes Compound Interest and displays an annual amortization schedule table.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   Develop a robust Python program that takes Principal \(P\), Annual Interest Rate \(R in percent\),) Tj
T*
(   Compounding Frequency \(n per year\), and Time Period \(t in years\). Compute the total Compound) Tj
T*
(   Interest and maturity amount, and display an formatted annual table.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Mathematical Formula:) Tj
T*
(   A = P * \(1 + R / \(100 * n\)\) ** \(n * t\)) Tj
T*
(   Compound Interest \(CI\) = A - P.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   def calculate_compound_interest\(principal, annual_rate, comp_freq, years\):) Tj
T*
(   print\("=" * 65\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"{'ANNUAL COMPOUND INTEREST AMORTIZATION SCHEDULE':^65}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("=" * 65\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Initial Principal: ${principal:,.2f} | Annual Rate: {annual_rate:.2f}% | Freq:) Tj
T*
(   {comp_freq}/yr"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("-" * 65\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"{'Year':<8}{'Opening Balance':<20}{'Interest Earned':<18}{'Closing Balance':<18}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("-" * 65\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   current_balance = principal) Tj
T*
(   rate_per_period = \(annual_rate / 100.0\) / comp_freq) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for yr in range\(1, years + 1\):) Tj
T*
(   opening = current_balance) Tj
T*
(   # Calculate balance after 1 full year \(comp_freq periods\)) Tj
T*
(   current_balance = opening * \(\(1 + rate_per_period\) ** comp_freq\)) Tj
T*
(   interest_this_year = current_balance - opening) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"{yr:<8}${opening:<19,.2f}${interest_this_year:<17,.2f}${current_balance:<17,.2f}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   total_interest = current_balance - principal) Tj
T*
(   print\("=" * 65\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Total Maturity Amount: ${current_balance:,.2f}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Total Compound Interest Accrued: ${total_interest:,.2f}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("=" * 65\)) Tj
T*
(   return current_balance) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Execution with test parameters) Tj
T*
(   calculate_compound_interest\(principal=10000.0, annual_rate=6.5, comp_freq=4, years=5\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Memory Model & Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Local Variables: 5 float numbers stored in the activation record.) Tj
T*
(   - Time Complexity: O\(years\) linear iteration over annual schedule.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(1\) auxiliary memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
