(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a comprehensive Python script demonstrating all Bitwise Operations to manipulate hardware register control flags \(Set, Clear, Toggle, Check\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   In embedded systems and low-level driver development, hardware status registers are manipulated) Tj
T*
(   using bitwise bit masks:) Tj
T*
(   - Set Bit: register |= \(1 << n\)) Tj
T*
(   - Clear Bit: register &= ~\(1 << n\)) Tj
T*
(   - Toggle Bit: register ^= \(1 << n\)) Tj
T*
(   - Check Bit: \(register & \(1 << n\)\) != 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   class HardwareRegister:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, initial_val=0x00\):) Tj
T*
(   self._reg = initial_val & 0xFF # Emulate 8-bit hardware register) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def set_bit\(self, bit_pos: int\):) Tj
T*
(   self._reg |= \(1 << bit_pos\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def clear_bit\(self, bit_pos: int\):) Tj
T*
(   self._reg &= ~\(1 << bit_pos\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def toggle_bit\(self, bit_pos: int\):) Tj
T*
(   self._reg ^= \(1 << bit_pos\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def is_bit_set\(self, bit_pos: int\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   return \(self._reg & \(1 << bit_pos\)\) != 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def display\(self, label=""\):) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"{label:<25} | Hex: 0x{self._reg:02X} | Bin: {self._reg:08b}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstration) Tj
T*
(   reg = HardwareRegister\(0b00000000\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.display\("Initial State"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Set Bit 3 \(e.g., Enable Motor\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.set_bit\(3\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.display\("After Setting Bit 3"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Set Bit 0 \(e.g., Power ON\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.set_bit\(0\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.display\("After Setting Bit 0"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Check Bit 3) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Is Bit 3 Active? {reg.is_bit_set\(3\)}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Toggle Bit 0 \(Turn Power OFF\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.toggle_bit\(0\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.display\("After Toggling Bit 0"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Clear Bit 3 \(Disable Motor\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.clear_bit\(3\)) Tj
T*
(   reg.display\("After Clearing Bit 3"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
ET

