12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Walrus Operator \(:=\) introduced in Python 3.8. Discuss its motivation, syntax, performance advantages, and write code demonstrating its practical use.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Motivation Behind the Assignment Expression \(PEP 572\):) Tj
T*
(   Prior to Python 3.8, assignment \(=\) was purely a statement and could not be used inside) Tj
T*
(   expressions \(such as while loops or if conditions\). Developers often had to write redundant) Tj
T*
(   duplicate calls or initialize variables outside loops.) Tj
T*
(   The Walrus Operator \(:=\), formally termed Assignment Expression, allows assigning values to) Tj
T*
(   variables inside expressions while simultaneously evaluating to that value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Syntax Comparison:) Tj
T*
(   - Without Walrus Operator:) Tj
T*
(   data = file.readline\(\)) Tj
T*
(   while data != '':) Tj
T*
(   process\(data\)) Tj
T*
(   data = file.readline\(\)) Tj
T*
(   - With Walrus Operator:) Tj
T*
(   while \(data := file.readline\(\)\) != '':) Tj
T*
(   process\(data\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   # Example 1: Streamlining Regex or String Parsing) Tj
T*
(   def process_data_stream\(\):) Tj
T*
(   inputs = ["python", "c++", "supercalifragilistic", "ai", "machinelearning"]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("Filtering words with length > 6 and printing both word and length:"\)) Tj
T*
(   # Using walrus operator inside list comprehension) Tj
T*
(   filtered = [\(w, n\) for w in inputs if \(n := len\(w\)\) > 6]) Tj
T*
(   for word, length in filtered:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" Word: '{word}' -> Length: {length}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   process_data_stream\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Example 2: Avoiding Duplicate Expensive Computations) Tj
T*
(   import math) Tj
T*
(   def check_heavy_computation\(x\):) Tj
T*
(   # Calculate expensive square root once and check threshold) Tj
T*
(   if \(val := math.sqrt\(x\)\) > 10:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Condition met! sqrt\({x}\) = {val:.2f} > 10"\)) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Condition not met! sqrt\({x}\) = {val:.2f} <= 10"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   check_heavy_computation\(144\)) Tj
T*
(   check_heavy_computation\(49\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
